   "metadata": {},
   "source": [
    "$$\n",
    "\\bigstar\\;\\diamond\\;\\bigstar\\quad\\boxed{\\sigma_{\\omega}\\sigma}\\quad\\bigstar\\;\\diamond\\;\\bigstar\n",
    "$$"
   ]
  },
  {
   "attachments": {
    "2.5.png": {
     "image/png": ".i.d."
    }
   },
   "cell_type": "markdown",
   "id": "6d8dbf0c",
   "metadata": {},
   "source": [
    "# 图 2.5\n",
    "\n",
    "![2.5.png](attachment:2.5.png)"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "markdown",
   "id": "d91b6e0b",
   "metadata": {},
   "source": [
    "$$\n",
    "\\bigstar\\;\\diamond\\;\\bigstar\\quad\\boxed{\\sigma_{\\omega}\\sigma}\\quad\\bigstar\\;\\diamond\\;\\bigstar\n",
    "$$"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "markdown",
   "id": "32a64eb7",
   "metadata": {},
   "source": [
    "## 背景信息\n",
    "\n",
    "图 2.5 左图展示了一维输入下,相关函数取 $R(x)=e^{-x^{2}/\\theta^{2}}$ 且 $\\theta=0.08$ 时,高斯过程的若干条样本路径.假设我们对函数采样得到观测数据,如图中蓝色圆点所示(图 2.5 中图),本章核心目标是求解给定数据后函数的后验分布;图 2.5 右图同样绘制了 $\\theta=0.08$ 条件下该后验高斯过程的若干样本路径.可以观察到所有样本路径均穿过观测数据点,且相较于先验分布,函数 $h(\\boldsymbol{x})$ 的整体不确定性大幅降低."
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "markdown",
   "id": "b9c0082c",
   "metadata": {},
   "source": [
    "$$\n",
    "\\bigstar\\;\\diamond\\;\\bigstar\\quad\\boxed{\\sigma_{\\omega}\\sigma}\\quad\\bigstar\\;\\diamond\\;\\bigstar\n",
    "$$"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "markdown",
   "id": "5e9c9262",
   "metadata": {},
   "source": [
    "## 指令"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "markdown",
   "id": "89e71d81",
   "metadata": {},
   "source": [
    "令画布宽 15 英寸,高 5 英寸,将画布分为 1x3:"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "markdown",
   "id": "d2fbf61b",
   "metadata": {},
   "source": [
    "```r\n",
    "options(repr.plot.width=15,repr.plot.height=5)\n",
    "par(mfrow=c(1,3))\n",
    "```"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "markdown",
   "id": "b135e1c0",
   "metadata": {},
   "source": [
    "定义函数 $f(x)=\\frac{10\\pi x}{1+64(x-.25)^{2}}+x^{2}$,在 $[0,1]$ 上取 301 个点用于绘制图像,计算其对应的真实函数值;再等距取 10 个观测点,计算其对应的观测值:"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "markdown",
   "id": "a32c602b",
   "metadata": {},
   "source": [
    "```r\n",
    "f=function(x) sin(10*pi*x)/(1+64*(x-.25)^2)+x^2\n",
    "N=301\n",
    "test=seq(0,1,length=N)\n",
    "true=f(test)\n",
    "n=10\n",
    "D=((1:n)-1)/(n-1)\n",
    "y=f(D)\n",
    "```"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "markdown",
   "id": "81e24b3a",
   "metadata": {},
   "source": [
    "令参数 $\\theta=0.08$,计算 $\\boldsymbol{R}$,$\\boldsymbol{R}^{-1}$,$\\boldsymbol{r}(\\boldsymbol{x})'$ 与 $\\boldsymbol{r}(\\boldsymbol{x})'\\boldsymbol{R}^{-1}$:依据 $\\widehat{\\mu}=\\frac{\\boldsymbol{1}'\\boldsymbol{R}^{-1}\\boldsymbol{y}}{\\boldsymbol{1}'\\boldsymbol{R}^{-1}\\boldsymbol{1}}$(广义一阶矩,广义最小二乘)计算 $\\widehat{\\mu}$;依据 $\\tau^{2}=\\frac{1}{n-1}\\cdot(\\boldsymbol{y}-\\widehat{\\mu}\\boldsymbol{1})'\\boldsymbol{R}^{-1}(\\boldsymbol{y}-\\widehat{\\mu}\\boldsymbol{1})$ 计算 $\\tau^{2}$:"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "markdown",
   "id": "e946ac40",
   "metadata": {},
   "source": [
    "```r\n",
    "theta=.08\n",
    "R=exp(-(outer(D,D,\"-\")/theta)^2)\n",
    "Rinv=solve(R)\n",
    "R_pred=exp(-(outer(test,D,\"-\")/theta)^2)\n",
    "one=rep(1,n)\n",
    "mu_hat=as.numeric((t(one)%*%Rinv%*%y)/(t(one)%*%Rinv%*%one))\n",
    "e=y-mu_hat\n",
    "tau2_hat=as.numeric(t(e)%*%Rinv%*%e/(n-1))\n",
    "pred=as.numeric(mu_hat+R_pred%*%Rinv%*%e)\n",
    "```"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "markdown",
   "id": "6a716dce",
   "metadata": {},
   "source": [
    "已知真实的函数 $h(\\boldsymbol{x})\\sim\\mathrm{GP}(\\mu(\\boldsymbol{x}),K(\\boldsymbol{x},\\cdot))$,因此依据公式 $K(\\boldsymbol{x},\\boldsymbol{u})=\\tau^{2}R(\\boldsymbol{x}-\\boldsymbol{u})$,还需要求解 $R(\\boldsymbol{x}-\\boldsymbol{u})$:"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "markdown",
   "id": "a5ac10ff",
   "metadata": {},
   "source": [
    "```r\n",
    "S0=exp(-(outer(test,test,\"-\")/theta)^2)\n",
    "```"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "markdown",
   "id": "28a73f8d",
   "metadata": {},
   "source": [
    "开始先验:使用 `MASS` 包中的 `mvrnorm` 函数从均值为 $0$,方差为 $\\tau^{2}R(\\boldsymbol{x}-\\boldsymbol{u})$ 的高斯过程中任意抽取 5 条曲线作为先验示例:"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "markdown",
   "id": "e6c3aee6",
   "metadata": {},
   "source": [
    "```r\n",
    "set.seed(1)\n",
    "library(MASS)\n",
    "u=mvrnorm(n=5,mu=rep(0,N),Sigma=tau2_hat*S0)\n",
    "```"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "markdown",
   "id": "c5d88c1e",
   "metadata": {},
   "source": [
    "开始作图:左图:一次性绘制多条图像,其中曲线类型为实线,$x$ 轴上标注为 `x`,$y$ 轴上标注为 `y`,颜色使用 2-6,线宽为 3,$y$ 轴显示范围为 $[\\min(f(x))-.25,\\max(f(x))+.25]$,主标题为"prior distribution",标题缩放系数为 3,坐标轴缩放系数为 2,轴标签缩放系数为 2;叠加真实函数图像,其中曲线类型为实线,线宽为 4:"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "markdown",
   "id": "156ccab6",
   "metadata": {},
   "source": [
    "```r\n",
    "matplot(test,t(u),type=\"l\",xlab=\"x\",ylab=\"y\",col=2:6,lwd=3,ylim=c(min(true)-.25,max(true)+.25),main=\"prior distribution\",cex.main=3,cex.axis=2,cex.lab=2)\n",
    "lines(test,true,type=\"l\",lwd=4)\n",
    "```"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "markdown",
   "id": "ce22fc78",
   "metadata": {},
   "source": [
    "中图:与左图相同,只是主标题换成"data";叠加观测点,其中点的类型为实心圆点,放缩系数为 4,颜色为蓝色:"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "markdown",
   "id": "17d6df07",
   "metadata": {},
   "source": [
    "```r\n",
    "matplot(test,t(u),type=\"l\",xlab=\"x\",ylab=\"y\",col=2:6,lwd=3,ylim=c(min(true)-.25,max(true)+.25),main=\"data\",cex.main=3,cex.axis=2,cex.lab=2)\n",
    "lines(test,true,type=\"l\",lwd=4)\n",
    "points(cbind(D,y),pch=16,cex=4,col=\"blue\")\n",
    "```"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "markdown",
   "id": "d8cca729",
   "metadata": {},
   "source": [
    "依据公式 $h(\\boldsymbol{x})\\mid\\boldsymbol{y}\\sim\\mathrm{GP}(\\mu+\\boldsymbol{r}(\\boldsymbol{x})'\\boldsymbol{R}^{-1}(\\boldsymbol{y}-\\mu\\boldsymbol{1}),\\tau^{2}(R(\\boldsymbol{x}-\\cdot)-\\boldsymbol{r}(\\boldsymbol{x})'\\boldsymbol{R}^{-1}\\boldsymbol{r}(\\cdot)))$,其中均值在克里金部分已算毕;还需计算方差部分:"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "markdown",
   "id": "7d540fd6",
   "metadata": {},
   "source": [
    "```r\n",
    "S=tau2_hat*(S0-R_pred%*%Rinv%*%t(R_pred))\n",
    "```"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "markdown",
   "id": "358a535a",
   "metadata": {},
   "source": [
    "开始后验:从均值为 $\\mu+\\boldsymbol{r}(\\boldsymbol{x})'\\boldsymbol{R}^{-1}(\\boldsymbol{y}-\\mu\\boldsymbol{1})$,方差为 $\\tau^{2}(R(\\boldsymbol{x}-\\cdot)-\\boldsymbol{r}(\\boldsymbol{x})'\\boldsymbol{R}^{-1}\\boldsymbol{r}(\\cdot))$ 的高斯过程中任意抽取 5 条曲线作为后验示例:"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "markdown",
   "id": "916d6a1e",
   "metadata": {},
   "source": [
    "```r\n",
    "set.seed(1)\n",
    "u=mvrnorm(n=5,mu=pred,Sigma=S)\n",
    "```"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "markdown",
   "id": "a4f99e50",
   "metadata": {},
   "source": [
    "右图:与中图一致,只是主标题改为"posterior distribution":"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "markdown",
   "id": "2efb7aef",
   "metadata": {},
   "source": [
    "```r\n",
    "matplot(test,t(u),type=\"l\",xlab=\"x\",ylab=\"y\",col=2:6,lwd=3,ylim=c(min(true)-.25,max(true)+.25),main=\"posterior distribution\",cex.main=3,cex.axis=2,cex.lab=2)\n",
    "lines(test,true,type=\"l\",lwd=4)\n",
    "points(cbind(D,y),pch=16,cex=4,col=\"blue\")\n",
    "```"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "markdown",
   "id": "ba400526",
   "metadata": {},
   "source": [
    "将画布还原回 1x1:"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "markdown",
   "id": "d14c28a6",
   "metadata": {},
   "source": [
    "```r\n",
    "par(mfrow=c(1,1))\n",
    "```"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "markdown",
   "id": "56863906",
   "metadata": {},
   "source": [
    "$$\n",
    "\\bigstar\\;\\diamond\\;\\bigstar\\quad\\boxed{\\sigma_{\\omega}\\sigma}\\quad\\bigstar\\;\\diamond\\;\\bigstar\n",
    "$$"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "markdown",
   "id": "6a795cf9",
   "metadata": {},
   "source": [
    "## 最终效果"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "code",
   "execution_count": 1,
   "id": "d100977d",
   "metadata": {
    "vscode": {
     "languageId": "r"
